      'faq.kicker': 'Help center', 'faq.title': 'Frequently asked questions', 'faq.description': 'Find quick answers about using TeamBalance every day. This guide is updated along with the platform features.', 'faq.searchLabel': 'Search for an answer', 'faq.searchPlaceholder': 'E.g. log hours, availability or subscription', 'faq.answerFound': 'answer found', 'faq.answersFound': 'answers found', 'faq.filterLabel': 'Filter questions by category', 'faq.listLabel': 'Frequently asked questions list', 'faq.emptyTitle': 'We could not find an answer for that search.', 'faq.emptyText': 'Try another word or contact the person responsible for your agency.', 'faq.needHelpKicker': 'Still need help?', 'faq.needHelpTitle': 'Open a support request', 'faq.needHelpDescription': 'HelpDesk lets you submit a request and continue the conversation when Support replies. Do not share passwords, verification codes or card details.', 'faq.openSupport': 'Open HelpDesk', 'faq.configureNewsletter': 'Configure newsletter', 'faq.category.all': 'All', 'faq.category.firstSteps': 'Getting started', 'faq.category.projects': 'Projects and tasks', 'faq.category.team': 'Team and availability', 'faq.category.account': 'Account and subscription', 'faq.access.question': 'How do I know which options I can use?', 'faq.access.answer': 'The available options depend on your role and permissions. If you need a missing feature, contact the person responsible for your agency.', 'faq.project.question': 'How do I create and plan a task?', 'faq.project.answer': 'From Projects, the PM enters task data and can assign a person or request a Best Fit suggestion.', 'faq.kanban.question': 'How do I update a task status or progress?', 'faq.kanban.answer': 'Open the task from the Kanban board. In its detail you can change status, mark subtasks and add comments.', 'faq.hours.question': 'Why can’t I log hours for a date?', 'faq.hours.answer': 'The record must respect the allowed date range, does not accept future dates and only allows tasks available to you.', 'faq.bestFit.question': 'What does Best Fit analyze?', 'faq.bestFit.answer': 'Best Fit compares required skills, seniority, availability and workload. It is a recommendation: it does not automatically assign or move anyone.', 'faq.availability.question': 'How do I report an absence or availability change?', 'faq.availability.answer': 'From My availability you can maintain your base schedule and register leaves or absences when needed.', 'faq.skills.question': 'What are skills and seniority for?', 'faq.skills.answer': 'Skills describe concrete capabilities and seniority indicates the recommended level for a task.', 'faq.subscription.question': 'How do I manage my agency subscription?', 'faq.subscription.answer': 'The Owner can check the current plan, history and renewal under Agency settings > Subscription.', 'faq.security.question': 'How do I protect my account?', 'faq.security.answer': 'Do not share credentials or verification codes. Use a strong password and report unexpected access.',
